  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon Element Rough combines the signature comfort and feel of the Element family with a rougher, shaped surface that increases ball bite and spin. Multi-Mono Technology and Luxilon's soft polymer construction help reduce harsh vibrations, making it one of the more arm-friendly polyester options in the Luxilon lineup. The 1.30 mm gauge adds durability and stability while maintaining the softer response that defines Element.",

    "zh": "Luxilon Element Rough 在 Element 系列柔和、舒适和高触球感的基础上，加入更粗糙、更具形状感的表面结构，从而提升咬球能力与旋转表现。Multi-Mono Technology 配合 Luxilon 较柔软的聚合物结构，有助于减少传统聚酯常见的生硬震动，因此它也是 Luxilon 系列中较为护臂的聚酯线之一。1.30毫米线径进一步增强耐久性与稳定性，同时保留 Element 系列标志性的柔和反馈。"
  },

